# language: en

Feature: Subscribe

    Scenario Outline: HeadlessApp_Subscribe_Sensor_Value
        Given PAL set sensor signal <path> to <datatype> <value>
        Given HeadlessApp subscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype>
        Then PAL set the signal at <path> of <datatype> to <values> by order, subscribe stream receive the same data
        And HeadlessApp unsubscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype> to close connections

    Examples:
        | path                                         | datatype  | value            | values            |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Convertible.IsOpen | bool | false | ["true","false"] |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Convertible.Position | uint8 | 50 | ["100","50","0"] |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.HVAC.AmbientAirTemperature | float | 0.0 | ["3.4028235e+38","0.0","-3.4028235e+38"] |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.HVAC.Station.Row1.DriverSide.AirDistribution | string | MIDDLE | ["UP","MIDDLE","DOWN"] |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Seat.Row1.DriverSide.Backrest.HeatingCooling | int8 | 0 | ["100","0","-100"] |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Seat.Row1.DriverSide.Height | uint16 | 32767 | ["65535","32767","0"] |
        
    Scenario Outline: Notification of subscribed signals
        Given a signal at <path> is set to <value_0> of datatype <datatype>
        And attempts to subscribe the signal at <path> of datatype <datatype> is succeeded
        When the value of signal at <path> changes to <value_1> of datatype <datatype>
        Then the subscribe stream returns <datatype> <value_1> on <path>
        And HeadlessApp unsubscribe the sensor signal <path> of <datatype> to close connections

    Examples:
        | path                                                     | datatype      | value_0       | value_1       |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Convertible.IsOpen | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Convertible.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.HVAC.AmbientAirTemperature | float | 0.0 | 3.4028235e+38 |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.HVAC.Station.Row1.DriverSide.AirDistribution | string | MIDDLE | UP |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Seat.Row1.DriverSide.Backrest.HeatingCooling | int8 | 0 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Cabin.Seat.Row1.DriverSide.Height | uint16 | 32767 | 65535 |
        
